    "Id": "mechdef_leliourium_I-LEM-OB",
    "Name": "Leliourium I-LEM-OB",
    "Details": "The third configuration of the Leliourium, the 'Beleth', has one role alone; to deliver the vengeance of the Manei Domini as direct as possible. To achieve this goal a new weapon was created, the Astral Hammer, said to be created by Blake himself. Mounting a total of four of these immense autocannons, and nothing else but a single SRM-6 launcher, means the 'Mech has to get quite close before being able to strike - but once there even the most brave of foes will think twice about staying close.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Wrath of Blake</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.39</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_leliourum"
  },
